WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.123
- What's been 
the hardest lesson

00:00:01.123 --> 00:00:02.713
for you to learn in your life?

00:00:02.713 --> 00:00:04.075
- [Gary] That 
I can't do everything.

00:00:04.075 --> 00:00:05.605
- What are things you would love

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:06.844
to be doing that 
you're not doing?

00:00:06.844 --> 00:00:08.133
- [Gary] Nothing.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.013
- You would rather 
be doing nothing?

00:00:10.013 --> 00:00:10.704
- [Gary] Nothing.

00:00:10.704 --> 00:00:13.124
- Or there is nothing--
- No, no, correct.

00:00:13.124 --> 00:00:15.414
There is nothing, 
I'm in full control of my life.

00:00:15.414 --> 00:00:16.895
If there's something 
I want to do

00:00:16.895 --> 00:00:18.104
then I can go do it.

00:00:18.104 --> 00:00:19.414
We make our beds.

00:00:19.414 --> 00:00:21.214
So, I sleep in it.

00:00:21.214 --> 00:00:22.703
- What do you think 
about your employees?

00:00:22.703 --> 00:00:25.613
Do you think they all 
share the same ideology

00:00:25.613 --> 00:00:27.065
that you do 
about doing everything

00:00:27.065 --> 00:00:28.437
that it is they 
want to be doing?

00:00:28.437 --> 00:00:29.444
- [Gary] Absolutely not.

00:00:29.444 --> 00:00:30.954
- Why do you think that is?

00:00:30.954 --> 00:00:33.813
- Because I think people 
are wired differently

00:00:33.813 --> 00:00:35.438
and I think I have to,

00:00:35.438 --> 00:00:36.644
I don't even want,

00:00:36.644 --> 00:00:39.235
all I want to do was 
react to what they want

00:00:39.235 --> 00:00:40.738
and how they aspire to be or

00:00:40.738 --> 00:00:42.206
what they're interested in.

00:00:42.206 --> 00:00:44.676
I have no interest 
in them being like me

00:00:44.676 --> 00:00:45.884
or not being like me.

00:00:45.884 --> 00:00:47.456
I'm in the reaction business.

00:00:47.456 --> 00:00:50.265
And so, I just think 
people are hardwired.

00:00:50.265 --> 00:00:52.065
I don't think everybody was 
as lucky to have a mother

00:00:52.065 --> 00:00:53.525
that told them 
they could do anything

00:00:53.525 --> 00:00:55.684
and actually make 
them believe it.

00:00:55.684 --> 00:00:57.055
And that's unfortunate

00:00:57.055 --> 00:01:00.066
and I hope through 
example and content

00:01:00.066 --> 00:01:02.155
I'm able to inspire that but

00:01:02.155 --> 00:01:05.674
I think practicality 
is grossly underrated

00:01:05.674 --> 00:01:08.210
and for all my sizzle,

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:10.146
I'm obsessed with the steak.

00:01:10.146 --> 00:01:12.825
(light music)

